# Reference grammar: tutorials/regression/lib.sh.
# probe <file> <time> <column> <expected> <tolerance>
# At t=0.035 the disconnected LV is not yet active and the intact RV is.
# The healthy tree activates the LV point at 28.8 ms and myocardial spread
# reaches it at 43.2 ms, so 0.035 separates block from health.
#
probe  postProcessing/injectionProbe/0/activationTime  0.035  2  -1         1e-4
probe  postProcessing/injectionProbe/0/activationTime  0.035  3  0.0130968  1e-4
